member.summary:
Gets or sets the units of alternate units ($DIMALTU), as AutoCAD's Dimaltu: 1 scientific, 2 decimal,
3 engineering, 4 architectural stacked, 5 fractional stacked, 6 architectural, 7 fractional, 8 the Windows desktop's;
2 where the header gives none.

Gets the picture of the drawing kept for previews, as AutoCAD's ThumbnailBitmap gives it as a bitmap: here the
bytes of the THUMBNAILIMAGE section, its groups 310 one after another, a bitmap of Windows without the file's header;
null where the file has none.

Works out which layers are in use, as AutoCAD's GenerateUsageData does before IsUsed is read: the layers
every entity is on, in one walk of the drawing, kept until the drawing next changes;
 works them out itself where they are not kept.

Writes the override of the viewport into an XRECORD of the layer's extension dictionary: the value of the viewport's
list replaced where it has one, else a list added after the others, as AutoCAD adds the list of a second viewport;
the dictionary and the XRECORD made where the layer has none.

member.remarks:
A dashed line of dashes 0.5 long with gaps of 0.25 is
var dashed = new DxfLinetypeTableRecord { Name = "DASHED", AsciiDescription = "__ __ __", NumDashes = 2 };,
dashed.SetDashLengthAt(0, 0.5); dashed.SetDashLengthAt(1, -0.25); and db.LinetypeTable.Add(dashed).

remarks.para:
Made in code, a definition is added to a drawing's dictionary under a name, and a  is then
made of it: DxfDBDictionary underlays = DxfPdfDefinition.CreatePdfDictionary(db);
underlays.SetAt(DxfPdfDefinition.SuggestName(underlays, path, "1"), new DxfPdfDefinition(path, "1"));

member.summary:
The bytes of a stream of the root storage, its name compared as MS-CFB compares them, letters of either case the same;
null where the root has no stream of the name, or, with the reason, where its sectors run past the end of the file or
in a loop.

Writes a stretch action driven by the end point of a linear or an XY parameter (EndXDelta, EndYDelta): its frame of
two corners, each entity with the indices of its points inside the frame, its distance multiplier and angle offset;
one node, and the edge from the parameter.

The graph of a block, made where it has none: the BLOCK_RECORD given its extension dictionary with the graph and
the purge preventer, and its extended data of the dynamic block (its true name and a new GUID) where it has none;
each entity of the block without a tag given the next, and the record the tag after the last.

The extended data of the dynamic block on its BLOCK_RECORD, and a tag on each of its entities that has none: the
application AcDbBlockRepETag with 1070 1, the tag (1071) and the entity's own handle (1005), as AutoCAD tags them;
the record's 1071 the tag after the last.

